      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The main problem I have with this tag is that it's a bit misleading in some cases.\n\nWhen I see \"Creator\", I think of someone who has created avatars, worlds and assets. However, there are a number of monetized groups I've seen within VRChat that don't create anything.\n\nIf it was limited to actual creators, ones that have avatars in the shop or a world, I think it would be mostly fine by just adding a tooltip.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
