      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "it is perhaps better read as \"Verified Creator\" given the twitter verified checkmark thing, though I do very much agree there is a problem of it excluding non-CE creators and generally being unclear to the average user.\n\ni like dean's suggestion of \"CE Seller\" as the tag name, it clarifies what it actually represents, and includes people who may be in the CE but aren't avatar/world creators.",
