      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{69ba3c32ed082c9981d6fed6|full_name}, I thought all monetized groups had a world associated with them. Interesting if this is not the case. Otherwise, maybe the group store pages are missing a way to show which worlds they are associated with?\n\nI guess my suggestion of changing it to \"CE Seller\" would indeed fit better if it includes sellers that don't technically create content.",
