      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Talked with another friend that has the tag, and they pointed out that some people would like the ability to hide the \"Creator\" tag too.\n\nSo at that point, why not just make it a badge? That way the user can hide it if they want, or semi-hide it among their other badges that aren't showcased on the profile.\n\nWorst case scenario, the badge will require an artist to make the badge art, and the code used to develop this tag will go unused.\n\nThe only advantages I see of the current \"Creator\" tag, is if VRChat wants to force people to have it visible, or if they want to implement some click-able redirect when the tag is clicked.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
