      "value": "VRChat 2026.3.1 (OPEN BETA) August 4, `Build 1881`: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202623-openbeta#august-4-build-1881\n\n> Removed the \"Creator\" tag.\n\n> > It needs more time in the oven! It didn't necessary convey what we wanted it to, so we're pulling it back... for now.",
