      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That’s the whole point, Verified Creator. You have to admit, developers shouldn’t have to go through various avatar marketplaces trying to figure out who’s actually creating avatars and who isn’t. Here, by gaining access to the marketplace, the avatar creator confirms that they are a “Verified Creator” and receives the corresponding badge.\n\nDon’t want verification? Keep selling where you’ve been selling — no one’s forcing you.🤷‍♀",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
